    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to no.24a Portmarnock Crescent a west facing 3 bedroom detached home with a fabulous attic conversion with panoramic views over Irelands Eye and Lambay Island. Located in the heart of Portmarnock and surrounded by large open green spaces providing the perfect safe haven for kids to run free all year round.\r\n\r\nThe property consists of an inviting entrance hall, spacious lounge with electric fire, sliding doors to open plan kitchen / dining and family room. On the first floor there are 3 spacious bedrooms, master ensuite, and a large family bathroom room. The converted attic provides a further space which needs to be viewed to be fully appreciated. This home is further enhanced by a west facing rear garden which has concrete shed, 2 side passages and is well manicured. The front driveway is cobble locked with space for 2 cars. \r\n\r\n\r\nSome of the properties main highlights;\r\n\r\nLocation – ideally situated just a short stroll to Portmarnock Beach and the renowned Portmarnock Hotel & Golf Links."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall\t2.15 x 4.72\tDecorative Semi-solid timber floor, spotlight, alarm \r\n\t\t\r\nGuest WC\t1.15 x 1.72\tTiled Floor, heated rail, whb, wc\r\n \r\nLounge    \t    4.05 x 3.95\tDecorative semi-solid timber floor, electric fireplace with Mounting, bi-folding doors, Tv point \r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen/Dining\t      6.37 x 3.53\tTiled flooring, fully fitted kitchen, double oven, hob, extractor fan, fridge/freezer, dishwasher, large island with built-in sink, radiator cover \r\n\t\t\r\nFamily room\t   3.5 x 3.5\tTiled floor, double doors to garden, two Velux ceiling windows \r\n \r\nStairs / landing\t\tStairs to converted attic, Hot press\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t2.43 x 2.76\tDecorative timber flooring, wardrobe \r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2\t3.2 x 4.42\tDecorative timber flooring, fitted sliding wardrobe,\r\n(including ensuite)\t\t\r\nEn Suite \t\tTiled floor & walls, walk in shower with waterfall effect, spotlights, wc, whb, heated rail, shaving point \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\t3.54 x 3.35\tDecorative timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom \t3.06 x 1.82\tTiled floor & walls, Vanity unit, mirror, wc, whb, heated rail, bath suit, electric Triton electric shower \r\n\r\nAttic Storage \t3.46 x 6.94\tDecorative timber flooring, feature circular window overlooking Portmarnock beach and Ireland Eye, 2 Velux windows overlooking Lambay Island \r\n\r\nConcrete Shed\t\tPlumbed for washer/dryer\r\n\r\nGarden\t\tMix of patio & lawn, fully walled, 2 side passages, external lighting"
      },
